<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A1.SS11" title="In Appendix A Technical Appendices and Supplementary Material ‣ Implicit Modeling for Transferability Estimation of Vision Foundation Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">A.11 </span>Embedding space mapping</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A1.SS12" title="In Appendix A Technical Appendices and Supplementary Material ‣ Implicit Modeling for Transferability Estimation of Vision Foundation Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">A.12 </span>Licenses</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
</ol></nav>
</nav>
<div class="ltx_page_main">
<div id="infobox" class="infobox">
