<section id="A1" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix A </span>Technical Appendices and Supplementary Material</h2>

<section id="A1.SS1" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">A.1 </span>Radar Chart</h3>

<figure id="A1.F5" class="ltx_figure"><img src="2510.23145v1/moti.png" id="A1.F5.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:476/220;" width="476" height="220" alt="Refer to caption">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 5: </span><span id="A1.F5.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Comparison between ITM, recent TE methods, and ground-truth performance across ten benchmarks.</span> Scores are normalized to <math id="A1.F5.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="[0.3,1]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mn>0.3</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">[0.3,1]</annotation></semantics></math> for clearer visualization. (a) Evaluation on MAE and CNN pre-trained models. Static TE methods (e.g., PARC <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">[<a href="#bib.bib18" title="" class="ltx_ref">18</a>]</cite> and ETran <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">[<a href="#bib.bib5" title="" class="ltx_ref">5</a>]</cite>) fail to generalize to MAE <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">[<a href="#bib.bib11" title="" class="ltx_ref">11</a>]</cite> due to weak discriminative power in initial embeddings. (b) Evaluation on DINO and MAE pre-trained models. Dynamic TE methods (e.g., SFDA <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">[<a href="#bib.bib17" title="" class="ltx_ref">17</a>]</cite> and PED <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">[<a href="#bib.bib7" title="" class="ltx_ref">7</a>]</cite>) overestimate MAE’s performance. In contrast, ITM generalizes well across diverse pre-trained models and provides accurate estimations.</figcaption>
</figure>
</section>
<section id="A1.SS2" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">A.2 </span>Pseudo-code</h3>

<figure id="alg1" class="ltx_float ltx_float_algorithm ltx_framed ltx_framed_top">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_float"><span id="alg1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Algorithm 1</span> </span> Training process of DVA without deparametric approximation</figcaption>
<div id="alg1.4" class="ltx_listing ltx_framed ltx_framed_topbottom ltx_listing">
<div id="alg1.l0" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.l0.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">0:</span></span>
              
              
             Embedding of training dataset <math id="alg1.l0.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{E}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>𝐄</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{E}</annotation></semantics></math> extracted by model <math id="alg1.l0.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\phi" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>ϕ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\phi</annotation></semantics></math>, target cluster center <math id="alg1.l0.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\hat{\mathbf{E}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐄</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\hat{\mathbf{E}}</annotation></semantics></math>, target label <math id="alg1.l0.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{Y}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>𝐘</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{Y}</annotation></semantics></math>, linear layers <math id="alg1.l0.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="f,g,h" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>g</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>h</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">f,g,h</annotation></semantics></math>, number of training iterations <math id="alg1.l0.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="T" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>T</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">T</annotation></semantics></math>, learning rate <math id="alg1.l0.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\alpha" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>α</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\alpha</annotation></semantics></math>, number of subspace iterations <math id="alg1.l0.m8" class="ltx_Math" alttext="M" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>M</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">M</annotation></semantics></math> and learning rate of subspace <math id="alg1.l0.m9" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\eta" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>η</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\eta</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l0a" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.l0a.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">0:</span></span>
              
              
             Optimized parameters <math id="alg1.l0a.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{W}_{z},\mathbf{W}_{g},\mathbf{W}_{h}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>𝐖</mi><mi>z</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝐖</mi><mi>g</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝐖</mi><mi>h</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{W}_{z},\mathbf{W}_{g},\mathbf{W}_{h}</annotation></semantics></math> of linear layers <math id="alg1.l0a.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="f,g,h" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>g</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>h</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">f,g,h</annotation></semantics></math>.

</div>
<div id="alg1.l1" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.l1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">1:</span></span>
              
              
             Randomly initialize <math id="alg1.l1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{W}_{z},\mathbf{W}_{h}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>𝐖</mi><mi>z</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝐖</mi><mi>h</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{W}_{z},\mathbf{W}_{h}</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l2" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.l2.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">2:</span></span>
              
              
             <span id="alg1.l2.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">for</span> <math id="alg1.l2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t=1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t=1</annotation></semantics></math> to <math id="alg1.l2.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="T" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>T</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">T</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="alg1.l2.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">do</span>



</div>
<div id="alg1.l3" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.l3.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">3:</span></span>
              
              
              Sample one batch of data: <math id="alg1.l3.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="(\mathbf{E}_{t},\hat{\mathbf{E}}_{t},\mathbf{Y}_{t})\leftarrow\text{sample}(\mathbf{E},\hat{\mathbf{E}},\mathbf{Y},t)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐄</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐄</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝐘</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mtext>sample</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐄</mi><mo>,</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐄</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>,</mo><mi>𝐘</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">(\mathbf{E}_{t},\hat{\mathbf{E}}_{t},\mathbf{Y}_{t})\leftarrow\text{sample}(\mathbf{E},\hat{\mathbf{E}},\mathbf{Y},t)</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l4" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.l4.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">4:</span></span>
              
              
              Compute <math id="alg1.l4.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{\Theta}_{t}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>𝚯</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{\Theta}_{t}</annotation></semantics></math>: <math id="alg1.l4.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{\Theta}_{t}\leftarrow f(\mathbf{E}_{t};\mathbf{W}_{z})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>𝚯</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐄</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝐖</mi><mi>z</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{\Theta}_{t}\leftarrow f(\mathbf{E}_{t};\mathbf{W}_{z})</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l5" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.l5.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">5:</span></span>
              
              
              Randomly initialize <math id="alg1.l5.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{W}_{g}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>𝐖</mi><mi>g</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{W}_{g}</annotation></semantics></math> 

</div>
<div id="alg1.l6" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.l6.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">6:</span></span>
              
              
              <span id="alg1.l6.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">for</span> <math id="alg1.l6.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="m=1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">m=1</annotation></semantics></math> to <math id="alg1.l6.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="M" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>M</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">M</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="alg1.l6.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">do</span>



</div>
<div id="alg1.l7" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.l7.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">7:</span></span>
              
              
               Compute gradient: <math id="alg1.l7.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="grad_{g}\leftarrow\nabla_{\mathbf{W}_{g}}\text{MSE}(g(\mathbf{\Theta}_{t}),\hat{\mathbf{E}_{t}})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>r</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>a</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>g</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mo rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><msub><mi>𝐖</mi><mi>g</mi></msub></msub><mtext>MSE</mtext></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝚯</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo><mover accent="true"><msub><mi>𝐄</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>^</mo></mover><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">grad_{g}\leftarrow\nabla_{\mathbf{W}_{g}}\text{MSE}(g(\mathbf{\Theta}_{t}),\hat{\mathbf{E}_{t}})</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l8" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.l8.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">8:</span></span>
              
              
               Update parameters of <math id="alg1.l8.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="g" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>g</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">g</annotation></semantics></math>: <math id="alg1.l8.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{W}_{g}\leftarrow\mathbf{W}_{g}-\eta\cdot grad_{g}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>𝐖</mi><mi>g</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝐖</mi><mi>g</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>η</mi><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><mi>g</mi></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>r</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>a</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>g</mi></msub></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{W}_{g}\leftarrow\mathbf{W}_{g}-\eta\cdot grad_{g}</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l9" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.l9.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">9:</span></span>
              
              
              <span id="alg1.l9.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">end</span> <span id="alg1.l9.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">for</span>
</div>
<div id="alg1.l10" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.l10.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">10:</span></span>
              
              
              Compute logits: <math id="alg1.l10.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="logits\leftarrow h(g(\mathbf{\Theta}_{t}))" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>l</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>o</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>g</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>i</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>t</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>s</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝚯</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">logits\leftarrow h(g(\mathbf{\Theta}_{t}))</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l11" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.l11.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">11:</span></span>
              
              
              Compute gradient: <math id="alg1.l11.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="grad_{f}\leftarrow\nabla_{\mathbf{W}_{z}}\text{CE}(logits,\mathbf{Y}_{t})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>r</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>a</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>f</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mo rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><msub><mi>𝐖</mi><mi>z</mi></msub></msub><mtext>CE</mtext></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>l</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>o</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>g</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>i</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>t</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>s</mi></mrow><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝐘</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">grad_{f}\leftarrow\nabla_{\mathbf{W}_{z}}\text{CE}(logits,\mathbf{Y}_{t})</annotation></semantics></math>,
<math id="alg1.l11.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="grad_{h}\leftarrow\nabla_{\mathbf{W}_{h}}\text{CE}(logits,\mathbf{Y}_{t})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>r</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>a</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>h</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mo rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><msub><mi>𝐖</mi><mi>h</mi></msub></msub><mtext>CE</mtext></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>l</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>o</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>g</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>i</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>t</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>s</mi></mrow><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝐘</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">grad_{h}\leftarrow\nabla_{\mathbf{W}_{h}}\text{CE}(logits,\mathbf{Y}_{t})</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l12" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.l12.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">12:</span></span>
              
              
              Update parameters of <math id="alg1.l12.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="f,h" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>h</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">f,h</annotation></semantics></math>: <math id="alg1.l12.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{W}_{z}\leftarrow\mathbf{W}_{z}-\alpha\cdot grad_{f}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>𝐖</mi><mi>z</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝐖</mi><mi>z</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><mi>g</mi></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>r</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>a</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>f</mi></msub></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{W}_{z}\leftarrow\mathbf{W}_{z}-\alpha\cdot grad_{f}</annotation></semantics></math>, <math id="alg1.l12.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{W}_{h}\leftarrow\mathbf{W}_{h}-\alpha\cdot grad_{h}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>𝐖</mi><mi>h</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝐖</mi><mi>h</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><mi>g</mi></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>r</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>a</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>h</mi></msub></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{W}_{h}\leftarrow\mathbf{W}_{h}-\alpha\cdot grad_{h}</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l13" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.l13.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">13:</span></span>
              
              
             <span id="alg1.l13.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">end</span> <span id="alg1.l13.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">for</span>
</div>
<div id="alg1.l14" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.l14.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">14:</span></span>
              
              
             <span id="alg1.l14.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">return</span> <math id="alg1.l14.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="W_{z},W_{g},W_{h}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>z</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>g</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>h</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">W_{z},W_{g},W_{h}</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
</div>
</figure>
<div id="A1.SS2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">As shown in Algorithm <a href="#alg1" title="Algorithm 1 ‣ A.2 Pseudo-code ‣ Appendix A Technical Appendices and Supplementary Material ‣ Implicit Modeling for Transferability Estimation of Vision Foundation Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">1</span></a>, DVA requires multiple training steps for the parameter <math id="A1.SS2.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="W_{g}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>g</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">W_{g}</annotation></semantics></math> during each macro iteration, followed by updates to the parameters <math id="A1.SS2.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="W_{z}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>z</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">W_{z}</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="A1.SS2.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="W_{h}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>h</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">W_{h}</annotation></semantics></math>. This “training within training" approach is not only challenging to implement but also inefficient. However, it clearly demonstrates the core idea of DVA: training the batch-specific parameter <math id="A1.SS2.p1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="W_{g}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>g</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">W_{g}</annotation></semantics></math> exclusively for each data batch.</p>
</div>
<figure id="alg2" class="ltx_float ltx_float_algorithm ltx_framed ltx_framed_top">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_float"><span id="alg2.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Algorithm 2</span> </span> Training process of DVA</figcaption>
<div id="alg2.4" class="ltx_listing ltx_framed ltx_framed_topbottom ltx_listing">
<div id="alg2.l0" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg2.l0.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">0:</span></span>
              
              
             Embedding of training dataset <math id="alg2.l0.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{E}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>𝐄</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{E}</annotation></semantics></math> extracted by model <math id="alg2.l0.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\phi" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>ϕ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\phi</annotation></semantics></math>, target cluster center <math id="alg2.l0.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\hat{\mathbf{E}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐄</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\hat{\mathbf{E}}</annotation></semantics></math>, target label <math id="alg2.l0.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{Y}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>𝐘</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{Y}</annotation></semantics></math>, linear layers <math id="alg2.l0.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="f,h" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>h</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">f,h</annotation></semantics></math>, number of training iterations <math id="alg2.l0.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="T" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>T</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">T</annotation></semantics></math>, learning rate <math id="alg2.l0.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\alpha" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>α</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\alpha</annotation></semantics></math>, number of subspace iterations <math id="alg2.l0.m8" class="ltx_Math" alttext="n" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>n</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">n</annotation></semantics></math> and learning rate of subspace <math id="alg2.l0.m9" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\eta" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>η</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\eta</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg2.l0a" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg2.l0a.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">0:</span></span>
              
              
             Optimized parameters <math id="alg2.l0a.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{W}_{z},\mathbf{W}_{h}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>𝐖</mi><mi>z</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝐖</mi><mi>h</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{W}_{z},\mathbf{W}_{h}</annotation></semantics></math> of linear layers <math id="alg2.l0a.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="f,h" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>h</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">f,h</annotation></semantics></math>.

</div>
<div id="alg2.l1" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg2.l1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">1:</span></span>
              
              
             Randomly initialize <math id="alg2.l1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{W}_{z},\mathbf{W}_{h}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>𝐖</mi><mi>z</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝐖</mi><mi>h</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{W}_{z},\mathbf{W}_{h}</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg2.l2" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg2.l2.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">2:</span></span>
              
              
             <span id="alg2.l2.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">for</span> <math id="alg2.l2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t=1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t=1</annotation></semantics></math> to <math id="alg2.l2.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="T" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>T</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">T</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="alg2.l2.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">do</span>



</div>
<div id="alg2.l3" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg2.l3.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">3:</span></span>
              
              
              Sample one batch of data: <math id="alg2.l3.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="(\mathbf{E}_{t},\hat{\mathbf{E}}_{t},\mathbf{Y}_{t})\leftarrow\text{sample}(\mathbf{E},\hat{\mathbf{E}},\mathbf{Y},t)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐄</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐄</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝐘</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mtext>sample</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐄</mi><mo>,</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐄</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>,</mo><mi>𝐘</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">(\mathbf{E}_{t},\hat{\mathbf{E}}_{t},\mathbf{Y}_{t})\leftarrow\text{sample}(\mathbf{E},\hat{\mathbf{E}},\mathbf{Y},t)</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg2.l4" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg2.l4.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">4:</span></span>
              
              
              Compute <math id="alg2.l4.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{\Theta}_{t}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>𝚯</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{\Theta}_{t}</annotation></semantics></math>: <math id="alg2.l4.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{\Theta}_{t}\leftarrow\mathbf{W}_{z}\mathbf{E}_{t}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>𝚯</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝐖</mi><mi>z</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝐄</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{\Theta}_{t}\leftarrow\mathbf{W}_{z}\mathbf{E}_{t}</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg2.l5" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg2.l5.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">5:</span></span>
              
              
              deparametric approximation: <math id="alg2.l5.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{E}^{(n)}_{t}\leftarrow(I-\eta\mathbf{C})^{n}(\mathbf{\Theta}_{t}-\hat{\mathbf{E}}_{j})+\hat{\mathbf{E}}_{j}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>𝐄</mi><mi>t</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi>η</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐂</mi></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mi>n</mi></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝚯</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐄</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐄</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{E}^{(n)}_{t}\leftarrow(I-\eta\mathbf{C})^{n}(\mathbf{\Theta}_{t}-\hat{\mathbf{E}}_{j})+\hat{\mathbf{E}}_{j}</annotation></semantics></math> (Eq. <a href="#S3.E5" title="In 3.3 Divide-and-conquer variational approximation ‣ 3 Methods ‣ Implicit Modeling for Transferability Estimation of Vision Foundation Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">5</span></a>)

</div>
<div id="alg2.l6" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg2.l6.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">6:</span></span>
              
              
              Compute logits: <math id="alg2.l6.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="logits\leftarrow h(\mathbf{E}^{(n)}_{t})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>l</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>o</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>g</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>i</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>t</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>s</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mi>𝐄</mi><mi>t</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">logits\leftarrow h(\mathbf{E}^{(n)}_{t})</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg2.l7" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg2.l7.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">7:</span></span>
              
              
              Compute gradient: <math id="alg2.l7.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="grad_{f}\leftarrow\nabla_{\mathbf{W}_{z}}\text{CE}(logits,\mathbf{Y}_{t})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>r</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>a</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>f</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mo rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><msub><mi>𝐖</mi><mi>z</mi></msub></msub><mtext>CE</mtext></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>l</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>o</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>g</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>i</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>t</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>s</mi></mrow><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝐘</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">grad_{f}\leftarrow\nabla_{\mathbf{W}_{z}}\text{CE}(logits,\mathbf{Y}_{t})</annotation></semantics></math>,
<math id="alg2.l7.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="grad_{h}\leftarrow\nabla_{\mathbf{W}_{h}}\text{CE}(logits,\mathbf{Y}_{t})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>r</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>a</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>h</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mo rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><msub><mi>𝐖</mi><mi>h</mi></msub></msub><mtext>CE</mtext></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>l</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>o</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>g</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>i</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>t</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>s</mi></mrow><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝐘</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">grad_{h}\leftarrow\nabla_{\mathbf{W}_{h}}\text{CE}(logits,\mathbf{Y}_{t})</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg2.l8" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg2.l8.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">8:</span></span>
              
              
              Update parameters of <math id="alg2.l8.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="f,h" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>h</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">f,h</annotation></semantics></math>: <math id="alg2.l8.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{W}_{z}\leftarrow\mathbf{W}_{z}-\alpha\cdot grad_{f}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>𝐖</mi><mi>z</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝐖</mi><mi>z</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><mi>g</mi></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>r</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>a</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>f</mi></msub></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{W}_{z}\leftarrow\mathbf{W}_{z}-\alpha\cdot grad_{f}</annotation></semantics></math>, <math id="alg2.l8.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{W}_{h}\leftarrow\mathbf{W}_{h}-\alpha\cdot grad_{h}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>𝐖</mi><mi>h</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝐖</mi><mi>h</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><mi>g</mi></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>r</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>a</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>h</mi></msub></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{W}_{h}\leftarrow\mathbf{W}_{h}-\alpha\cdot grad_{h}</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg2.l9" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg2.l9.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">9:</span></span>
              
              
             <span id="alg2.l9.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">end</span> <span id="alg2.l9.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">for</span>
</div>
<div id="alg2.l10" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg2.l10.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">10:</span></span>
              
              
             <span id="alg2.l10.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">return</span> <math id="alg2.l10.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="W_{z},W_{h}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>z</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>h</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">W_{z},W_{h}</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
</div>
</figure>
<div id="A1.SS2.p2" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS2.p2.1" class="ltx_p">As shown in Algorithm <a href="#alg2" title="Algorithm 2 ‣ A.2 Pseudo-code ‣ Appendix A Technical Appendices and Supplementary Material ‣ Implicit Modeling for Transferability Estimation of Vision Foundation Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">2</span></a>, we introduced the deparametric approximation method, which eliminates the need for training the linear layer <math id="A1.SS2.p2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="g" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>g</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">g</annotation></semantics></math> in lines 5 to 9 of Algorithm <a href="#alg1" title="Algorithm 1 ‣ A.2 Pseudo-code ‣ Appendix A Technical Appendices and Supplementary Material ‣ Implicit Modeling for Transferability Estimation of Vision Foundation Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">1</span></a>. Instead, the feature output <math id="A1.SS2.p2.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{E}^{(n)}_{t}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msubsup><mi>𝐄</mi><mi>t</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{E}^{(n)}_{t}</annotation></semantics></math> after several iterations is directly obtained using <math id="A1.SS2.p2.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="n" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>n</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">n</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="A1.SS2.p2.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\eta" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>η</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\eta</annotation></semantics></math>. Additionally, we employ the Pseudo-clustering Optimization method to generate pseudo-cluster centers that guide the convergence direction of <math id="A1.SS2.p2.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{E}^{(n)}_{t}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msubsup><mi>𝐄</mi><mi>t</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{E}^{(n)}_{t}</annotation></semantics></math>. Finally, <math id="A1.SS2.p2.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="f" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>f</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">f</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="A1.SS2.p2.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="h" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>h</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">h</annotation></semantics></math> are trained directly using CrossEntropy loss function.</p>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A1.SS3" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">A.3 </span>Role of Latent Variable <math id="A1.SS3.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="z" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>z</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">z</annotation></semantics></math></h3>

<figure id="A1.T4" class="ltx_table">
