<figure id="A1.F6" class="ltx_figure"><img src="2510.23145v1/benchmark.png" id="A1.F6.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:476/116;" width="476" height="116" alt="Refer to caption">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 6: </span><span id="A1.F6.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Performance comparison of model zoo entries across benchmarks.</span> Under identical dataset settings across four benchmarks, the benchmark adopted in ITM better realizes the potential of each model and consistently delivers stronger performance than those used in prior studies, providing a more realistic evaluation of real-world model selection scenarios.</figcaption>
</figure>
